    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="errata">

                <pb facs="0789" n="717" sameAs="frus:frus1865p4/pg717"/>

                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following error has been identified in <hi rendition="#italic">Papers
                        Relating to Foreign Affairs, Accompanying the Annual Message of the
                        President to the Second Session Thirty-eighth Congress</hi>. Please be aware
                    that printed volumes have not been revised.
                    <!--Revised information is in italic.--></p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. <ref target="#d779">Document 779</ref> (date of
                            errata entry: February 6, 2015)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The Index to Appendix of this volume notes that <ref target="#d779"
                            >Document 779</ref> should be under the head of <ref target="#ch20"
                            >Hawaiian Islands</ref> not Liberia.</item>
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">2. <ref target="#d256">Document 256</ref>, Page 167
                            (date of errata entry: July 19, 2017)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The dateline of Document 256 has been corrected from “Borough of Brighton,
                        May 2, 1861” to “Borough of Brighton, May 2, 1865”.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
